Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix: preserve markdown tables and inline-code escaping in
 RichInput Source/Edit roundtrip

---
 packages/ui/package.json                      |  1 +
 .../dialog/ExpandRichInputDialog.jsx          | 47 ++++++++++++++++++-
 .../ui/src/ui-component/input/RichInput.jsx   | 47 ++++++++++++++++++-
 pnpm-lock.yaml                                | 14 ++++++
 4 files changed, 107 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

